{"version":1,"content":"<p>今日（3日）傍晚時分，佐敦德成街一個路面地盤爆水管，有水湧出路面。</p><p>據附近商戶閉路電視拍攝到，當時挖泥機正在挖掘路面，挖斗懷疑撞破水管，突然大量水從地下湧出路面，附近工人四散躲避。</p><p>現場所見，地盤由水務署膠馬圍封，懷疑涉及水務署工程。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.342371+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T12:58:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:38:24.562054+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:31.342371+00:00","content_hash":"2d82b9e2d67217b515491537fbcff47a865c3dd07c2c543ac6b3ff887af57f77","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}